Payments by a Loan Party to another Loan Party; (b) transactions permitted under Section  6.03 ; 
 (c) Restricted Payments so long as the Payment Conditions are satisfied with respect to each such Restricted Payment; and 
 (d) Restricted Payments in an aggregate amount not to exceed $500,000 in any fiscal year of Parent (it being understood and agreed that any
Restricted Payment made pursuant this clause (d) shall only be permitted if such Restricted Payment would not, at the time thereof, be permitted (or be able to be made) under any other clause of this Section  6.11 ).
 SECTION  6.12 [ Reserved ]. 
 SECTION  6.13 Investments . Directly or indirectly, make or acquire any Investment, or incur any liabilities
(including contingent obligations) for or in connection with any Investment; provided , however , that the foregoing shall not prohibit any of the following: 
 (a) Investments set forth on Schedule 6.13 ; 
 (b) Investments in Cash Equivalents; 
 (c) Investments in negotiable instruments for collection; 
 (d) advances made in connection with purchases of goods or services in the ordinary course of business; 
 (e) Investments by any Loan Party in any other Loan Party (including Investments made by any Loan Party in the Parent); 
 (f) guarantees permitted under Section  6.01 ; 
 (g) Investments in any newly created Subsidiary by means of purchase or other acquisition of the Stock of such Subsidiary including by way of
merger; (h) Investments in joint ventures in an aggregate amount not exceeding $35,000,000; 
 (i) Investments in respect of Swap Obligations and Third Party Swap Obligations; 
 (j) Special Permitted Investments; 
 (k) Investments to the extent the Payment Conditions are satisfied; and 
 (l) Investments not to exceed $5,000,000 in the aggregate outstanding at any one time (it being understood and agreed that any Investment made
